## 📥 Installation

1. Go to the [Latest Releases](https://github.com/Thegreenmoray/seapig/releases/latest) page.
2. Download the binary matching your operating system:
   * **Windows:** `seapig-windows-amd64.exe`
   * **macOS (Apple Silicon M1/M2/M3):** `seapig-darwin-arm64`
   * **macOS (Intel):** `seapig-darwin-amd64`
   * **Linux:** `seapig-linux-amd64`
3. *(Linux/macOS only)* Make the file executable:
   ```bash
   chmod +x seapig-darwin-arm64
   mv seapig-darwin-arm64 /usr/local/bin/seapig




